---
/** F2: what an agent may do on its own vs what needs a person's approval. Mirrors safe-actions.instructions.md. */
const rows = [
  { may: 'Read code, docs, logs and tickets', ask: 'Push a branch, open or merge a pull request' },
  { may: 'Run builds, tests and read-only scripts', ask: 'Change a ticket’s status or assignee' },
  { may: 'Create a local branch and commit to it', ask: 'Send or post anything a person will read' },
  { may: 'Draft PR descriptions, review notes and replies', ask: 'Add or upgrade a package' },
  { may: 'Propose a root cause with evidence', ask: 'Touch any environment beyond the local machine' },
];
---

<figure class="mmn">
  <div class="scroll">
    <table>
      <caption class="sr-only">What an agent may do on its own, and what needs a person’s approval first</caption>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th scope="col" class="may-h">May do alone</th>
          <th scope="col" class="ask-h"><span class="sq" aria-hidden="true"></span>Asks a person first</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {
          rows.map((r) => (
            <tr>
              <td>{r.may}</td>
              <td>{r.ask}</td>
            </tr>
          ))
        }
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    The right-hand column is where the agent stops, shows exactly what it is about to do, and waits. A yes covers one
    action, not the rest of the session.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .mmn {
    margin: var(--s-7) 0;
  }
  .scroll {
    overflow-x: auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--r-lg);
    background: var(--surface);
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 0.9875rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  th,
  td {
    width: 50%;
    padding: var(--s-3) var(--s-4);
    text-align: left;
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  th {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--fs-label);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-block: var(--s-4) var(--s-3);
  }
  .may-h {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .ask-h {
    color: var(--gate);
  }
  .sq {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 9px;
    height: 9px;
    margin-right: 8px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: var(--gate);
  }
  td + td,
  th + th {
    border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  td + td {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--gate) 5%, transparent);
  }
  tbody tr + tr td {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  figcaption {
    margin-top: var(--s-3);
    font-size: var(--fs-small);
    color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>
